{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16304240","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16304240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1630424001:1":{"text":"거 참, 그렇게까지 화를 낼 일인가...","source_cn":"哎哟，那么凶干嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8CF177341D1192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1630424002:1":{"text":"들었으면 알아서 나와야지!","source_cn":"你倒是挪个地方啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x573DC4FBE9805ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1630424003:1":{"text":"내가 당신들한테 무슨 짓을 했나? 오히려 당신이 지금 나를 위협하고 있잖아.","source_cn":"我又不打扰你们。反倒是你，真的很打扰我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC60135D4DA0A578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1630424004:1":{"text":"여기는 낚시 금지라고 말했잖아!","source_cn":"这里不允许钓鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F03214AEB3A9B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1630424005:1":{"text":"여기는 위험하다니까! 여기는 우리 상단이 짐을 내리는 곳이야. 관계자 외에는 다 나가라고!","source_cn":"这里非常危险！我们商队要在这里卸货，无关人等都离开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF839887F440EB49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1630424006:1":{"text":"그냥 여기 앉아 있을 테니까 신경 쓰지 마.","source_cn":"我就坐在这里，不打扰你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E5CA0FBA666449B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1630424007:1":{"text":"...좋아. 대신 네가 바다에 빠져도 절대 구해주지 않을 거다!","source_cn":"……好吧。听着，如果你掉进海里，我是不会把你钓上来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB9E3D184368C06F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:凯兰":{"text":"케일란","source":"凯兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西顿":{"text":"시튼","source":"西顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}